    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"About us\"\ndate: 2026-09-29\ndate-modified: last-modified\ndraft: true\n---\n\n\n\n\nWelcome!\nThis project is maintained by the UN Task Team on Scanner data.\n\n# Who are we?\n\n## More about the Task Team\n\nThe Task Team on Scanner data is one of the workstreams stood up and supported by the CEBD.\nRead more about us [here](https://unstats.un.org/bigdata/task-teams/scanner/index.cshtml).\n\n## Who is on the Task Team?\n\nCheck out the acknowledgement section to see the full list of current and past participants\n\n# Roster of experts\n\n::: callout-note\n## TBC\n\nA roster of experts by topic will be added here\n:::\n\n# Our presentations\n\nWe are active in the price statistics space and have presented at several conferences.\n@tbl-task-team-presentations shows our main recent presentations.\n\n::: {#tbl-task-team-presentations .cell execution_count=1}\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display}\n```{=html}\n<!--| quarto-html-table-processing: none -->\n<table id=\"itables_835771c4_4de4_4b9b_8459_687f9a392492\" hidden=\"hidden\">\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"vertical-align:middle; text-align:left\"><a href=https://itables.org/><svg class=\"main-svg\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"\nwidth=\"64\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 400\" style=\"font-family: 'Droid Sans', sans-serif;\">\n    <g style=\"fill:var(--itables-logo-paper,#d9d7fc)\">\n        <path d=\"M100,400H500V357H100Z\" />\n        <path d=\"M100,300H400V257H100Z\" />\n        <path d=\"M0,200H400V157H0Z\" />\n        <path d=\"M100,100H500V57H100Z\" />\n        <path d=\"M100,350H500V307H100Z\" />\n        <path d=\"M100,250H400V207H100Z\" />\n        <path d=\"M0,150H400V107H0Z\" />\n        <path d=\"M100,50H500V7H100Z\" />\n    </g>\n    <g style=\"fill:var(--itables-logo-ink,#1a1366);stroke:var(--itables-logo-ink,#1a1366);\">\n   <rect x=\"100\" y=\"7\" width=\"400\" height=\"43\">\n    <animate\n      attributeName=\"w